    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"period\" though. i don't think it's a dip. i think i've actually peaked. like, the talent is gone and there's nothing left to refill. i look at my old work and i realize that was the ceiling. everything from here on out is just going to be me trying to scrape the bottom of the barrel. i’d honestly rather just stop everything now while i’m still \"something\" than live to see myself become a total joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
