      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that you have peaked is a very heavy burden, but it's a common trap the most talented people fall into. Instead of viewing your past success as a ceiling, try seeing it as a foundation that has given you a powerful perspective. Perhaps the next phase of your art doesn't need to be *better* than before, but something entirely different, an exploration that embraces the change you feel. Don't let the fear of decline force you into silence.",
      "source": "target",
